const websiteVisuals={danone:['Grameen Danone website launch','Grameen Danone launch announcement and website across devices'],aarong:['Aarong Dairy website launch','Aarong Dairy historical website launch visual'],care:['Care Nutrition website launch','Care Nutrition brand website homepage']};
document.querySelectorAll('[data-website]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{lastTrigger=button;const key=button.dataset.website;content.replaceChildren();content.append(el('p','WEBSITES & DIGITAL COMMERCE','eyebrow'),el('h2',websiteVisuals[key][0]));content.lastChild.id='dialog-title';const img=el('img');img.src='assets/websites/'+key+'.webp';img.alt=websiteVisuals[key][1];img.className='website-full';content.append(img);dialog.showModal();document.body.classList.add('modal-open');dialog.scrollTop=0;}));
